  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;By virtue of its siting, design and layout,&amp;nbsp;the\r\nproposed wraparound extension would result in an unacceptable impact on the\r\nliving conditions of existing occupiers in terms of increased sense of\r\nenclosure, loss of outlook, light and sunlight, as a result of the two\r\nbedroom&amp;nbsp;windows fronting&amp;nbsp;into the courtyard layout and being\r\nwithin&amp;nbsp;close proximity. This impact upon amenity in habitable rooms is to\r\nthe detriment of the long term health and well-being of these residential\r\noccupiers. In light of this, the development is contrary to Policy 57 of the\r\nadopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
